11 (84457) jwatson8@uwo.ca Faculty Scholar Award Terms of Reference (PDF) Assembling a Faculty Scholar Nomination (PDF) * Submit nominations by January 30, 2026. Please submit nominations to Heather Skilling - hskillin@uwo.ca Academic Planning Vice-Provost Interdisciplinary Development Initiatives Distinguished University Professorships (DUP) Award Faculty Scholar Award © 1878 - 2026 Western University Vice-Provost (Academic Planning, Policy & Faculty) International and Graduate Affairs Building, Suite ON70, Lower Level London, Ontario, Canada, N6A 3K7 Tel: 519.850.2900 ofrweb@uwo.ca Privacy | Web Standards | Terms of Use | Accessibility Key Topics: Academic Planning Faculty Relations Recruitment & Onboarding Canada Research Chairs Academic Careers"
