sition (PDF) Clinical Academic Appointment:  Clinician Researcher (PDF) (top) Psychiatry Application for Full-Time Clinical Academic Position (PDF) Psychiatry - Division of General Adult Psychiatry - Clinical Academic Psychiatrist (PDF) Psychiatry - Division of General Adult Psychiiatry - Clinical Academic Psychiatrist & Medical Director (Inpatients) (PDF) Psychiatry - Division of Forensic Psychiatry - Clinical Academic Psychiatrist (PDF) Psychiatry - Division of Child and Adolescent Psychiatry - Clinical Academics Psychiatrist (PDF) Psychiatry - Division of Geriatric Psychiatry - Clinical Academic Psychiatrist (PDF) (top) Surgery Application for Full-Time Clinical Academic Position (PDF) Surgery - Division of Paediatric Surgery and Division of Plastic and Reconstructive Surgery - Paediatric Plastic Surgeon (PDF) Surgery - Division of Plastic & Reconstructive Surgery - Plastic & Reconstructive Surgeon (PDF) Surgery - Division of Orthopaedic Surgery and Paediatric Surgery - Paediatric Orthopaedic Surgeon (PDF) Surgery - Division of General Surgery - Academic Breast Surgeon (PDF) Surgery - Division of General Surgery - Academic Colon & Rectal Surgeon (PDF) Surgery - Division of General Surgery - Academic Endocrine Surgeon (PDF) Surgery - Division of General Surgery - Academic Surgical Oncologist (PDF) Surgery - Division of Orthopaedic Knee Sport Medicine Surgeon (PDF) Surgery - Division of Orthopaedic Surgery and Paediatric Surgery - Paediatric Orthopaedic Surgeon (PDF) Surgery - Division of Plastic and Reconstructive Surgery - Academic Plastic & Reconstructive Surgeon (PDF) Surgery - Division of Vascular Surgery - Vascular Surgeon (PDF Surgery - Division of Orthopaedic Surgery - Academic Orthopaedic Surgeon (hand & Wrist Surgery) (PDF) Surgery - Division Chair/Division Head/Chief and Academic Vascular Surgeon (PDF) Surgery - Division of Urology - Clinical Academic Urologist (PDF) Surgery - Division of Urology - Clinical Academic Urologist - Joint role between St. Tho