    "https://www.edu.uwo.ca/": {
      "title": "Faculty of Education",
      "description": "Faculty of Education - Faculty of Education - Western University Skip to Content Faculty / Staff Search First Name Last Name or Department / Unit Search Search String Libraries Maps Parking Directory Websites A - Z Events WebMail OWL Brightspace Student Services WesternU.ca About Us | Current Students | Research | Indigenous Education | Alumni Popular Links Popular Links Directory Mail OWL Student Services Websites A - Z Events Libraries Maps Parking WesternU Resources for Resources: About Us Current Students Research Indigenous Education Alumni Teacher Education Associate Dean, Teacher Education message Primary/Junior Program Junior/Intermediate Program Intermediate/Senior Program ASPIRE - Additional Qualifications How to Apply Current Teacher Ed Students Contact the Teacher Ed Office Graduate Education Master of Arts Master of Professional Education Doctor of Education Doctor of Philosophy How to Apply Current Graduate Students Contact The Grad Office International Baccalaureate FAQ Resources How to Apply to the IB Program ASPIRE AQ OpenEdu MENU Teacher Education Graduate Education International Baccalaureate ASPIRE AQ OpenEdu Meet Colin King Learn how this Western Education professor and psychologist is using storybooks to help families manage children's anxiety A grand collaboration for Canada and the world 1 2 3 4 Previous Next Meet Colin King Learn how this Western Education professor and psychologist is using storybooks to help families manage children's anxiety A grand collaboration for Canada and the world Learn about our Teacher Education Learn about our Graduate Programs Learn about our Additional Qualifications Courses Learn about our faculty's research The Western Education Difference Western ranked top 1% We’re ranked in the top 1% of universities and 190 th in the world according to THE World University Rankings. Making us your go to spot for studying at an internationally respected university. Award-winning professors Our incredible faculty will help you every step of your academic journey. They’ve been recognized with many awards, including the Hellmuth Prize for Achievement in Research, a Heritage Plaque from Research Western and an Order of Canada and an Order of Ontario. Supportive initiatives and events We have our own dedicated students’ council that organizes awards as well as professional and social events, such as the grad formal. Diverse community With more than 1,000 students from Canada and around the world, we offer a community that energizes our halls and our online programs. Faculty-specific scholarships We offer scholarships for a variety of programs that can help you financially while you get one of our degrees. Degree and program choice Become an expert in your field. With Teacher Education, Master’s and Doctorate degrees, along with Additional Qualifications and certificates, you can choose the program that’s right for your career. The Western Education Difference Western ranked top 1% Western ranked top 1% We’re ranked in the top 1% of universities and 190 th in the world according to THE World University Rankings. Making us your go to spot for studying at an internationally respected university. Award-winning professors Award-winning professors Our incredible faculty will help you every step of your academic journey. They’ve been recognized with many awards, including the Hellmuth Prize for Achievement in Research, a Heritage Plaque from Research Western and an Order of Canada and an Order of Ontario. Supportive initiatives and events Supportive initiatives and events We have our own dedicated students’ council that organizes awards as well as professional and social events, such as the grad formal. Diverse community Diverse community With more than 1,000 students from Canada and around the world, we offer a community that energizes our halls and our online programs. Faculty-specific scholarships Faculty-specific scholarships We offer scholarships for a variety of programs that can help you financially while you get one of our degrees. Degree and program choice Degree and program choice Become an expert in your field. With Teacher Education, Master’s and Doctorate degrees, along with Additional Qualifications and certificates, you can choose the program that’s right for your career. Western Education Spotlight Western Education welcomes Chinese delegation to explore cross-institutional partnerships August 28, 2026 Western Education was pleased to welcome a group of nine senior administrators and faculty members from leading Chinese research-intensive ... Professor Daniel Ansari elected as Fellow of the CAHS August 27, 2026 Professor Ansari has been elected to one of Canada’s highest honours in health sciences research and leadership. Immaculate Namukasa renewed as Associate Dean, Graduate Education August 14, 2026 Immaculate Namukasa’s second term as Associate Dean, Graduate Education began on July 1, 2026. Memorial gift honours Winnifred Tew’s legacy of community care July 17, 2026 Inspired by her mother Winnifred Tew’s commitment to supporting children and families Katherine Tew Darras has made a generous donation to ... Neil Dyal on following his passions and finding purpose July 07, 2026 Neil Dyal, BEd '96, shares how teaching and school administration allowed him to combine his love of music and science. Spring awards ceremony recognizes exceptional student achievement June 18, 2026 Western Education celebrates standout students in teacher and graduate education programs. See More News September 2026 today Sun Mon Tue Wed Thu Fri Sat 30 31 1 2 3 4 5 6 7 8 9 8p MPEd in the field of Teaching English to Speakers of Other Languages (TESOL) - Information Session 10 12p MPEd in the Field of Global and International Education 5p MPEd in the Field of Educational Leadership - Information Session 11 5p MPEd in the field of Applied Behaviour Analysis - Information Session 12 13 14 5p MPEd in the field of Leadership in Indigenous Education - Information Session 15 5p MPEd in the field of Teaching Students with Exceptionalities - Information Session 16 17 18 5p MA/PhD in the Field of School and Applied Child Psychology - Information Session 19 20 21 5p EdD in the field of Educational Leadership - Information Session 22 12p ‘The Internet has become a sort of spring for Aromanians.’ Has it? 5p Teacher Education Information Session 23 24 25 5p MPEd in the field of Early Childhood Education - Information Session 26 27 28 5p MA Counselling Psychology - Information Session 29 30 1 12p Research Ethics Workshop 2 3 4 5 5p Teacher Education Information Session 6 7 12p MPEd in the field of Equity, Diversity and Social Justice - Information Session 12p Teacher Education Information Session 8 12p MPEd in the field of Leadership in Indigenous Education - Information Session 9 10 See More Events SUPPORT SERVICES HAVE QUESTIONS? © 1878 - 2026 Western University Faculty of Education 1137 Western Road London, Ontario, Canada, N6G 1G7 Tel: 519-661-3182 education@uwo.ca Privacy | Web Standards | Terms of Use | Accessibility More About Us News and Events Resources Support Services Social Media Contact Us Popular Resources: Faculty Events Education Support Portal Current Students Education Library Now chatting Hi! Let’s get some quick info so we can better serve you: * indicates a required field Name* Required Asterisk signifies that this field can not be left blank Email* Required Asterisk signifies that this field can not be left blank What program are you interested in?* Required Asterisk signifies that this field can not be left blank Graduate Program BEd ASPIRE - AQ International Baccalaureate General Inquiry Start chatting powered by Olark Logo Olark launch button clip path 0 Chat with us"
