hool of Biomedical Engineering Learn More Women in Engineering Learn More News Western recruits renowned severe storm risk and resilience expert as Eddie Goldenberg Research Chair Seth Guikema, an internationally recognized civil and environmental engineer, is joining Western as the Eddie Goldenberg Research Chair of Canada in Climate Risk and Resilience Analytics, receiving $8 million in federal funding.  His arrival strengthens Western’s growing international leadership in natural hazards research, adding a new dimension to the work already underway through the Canadian Severe Storms Laboratory. Makerspaces at Western thrive under student leadership Engineering Outreach at Western University receives $201,500  in funding from Actua to support youth STEM programs Borouge International inspires young minds through STEM at Western's Discovery Summer Camp The Impact Project: How to develop accessible, lifesaving technology Western University's Hesham El Naggar named joint winner of ISET Shamsher Prakash Award for Life-Time Contributions in Geotechnical Earthquake Engineering More News Important Links Social Media Guide Student Clubs Amit Chakma Engineering Building Youth and Summer Programs Working Together Equity, Diversity & Inclusion About Western Engineering Hire a Student ITG Help Desk Accessibility Social Media Guide Student Clubs Amit Chakma Engineering Building Youth and Summer Programs Working Together Equity, Diversity & Inclusion About Western Engineering Hire a Student ITG Help Desk Accessibility Undergraduate Viewbook Graduate Viewbook Equity, Diversity, Inclusion and Decolonization Faculty Recruitment Youth & Summer Programs Find an Expert Events 2026-09-22 Canadian Graduate Engineering Fair 2026-11-12 Western Engineering Leaders' Reception 2026 © 1878 - 2026 Western University Western Engineering Spencer Engineering Building, Western University London, Ontario, Canada, N6A 5B9 Tel: 519-661-2111 contactWE@eng.uwo.ca Privacy | Web Standards | Terms of Use