o.ca Heather Skilling Administrative Assistant 519-850-2900 hskillin@uwo.ca Margaret Poirier Senior Analyst 519-661-2111 (81150) mpoiri@uwo.ca Julie Watson Records Management Coordinator 519-661-2111 (84457) jwatson8@uwo.ca Faculty (UWOFA) For all Limited Duties postings (excluding course authoring appointments), please visit Working at Western, Employment Opportunities. Working at Western opportunities have expanded to include online applications for Limited Duties appointments, moving a highly paper-based, slower process to an efficient, secure online experience. When at the site, please select the appropriate link under the Logging in section. From the Working at Western Career’s Home page, View all Jobs and search by Posting Type: Faculty and use the other search features to find the Department/School/Faculty you wish to explore for opportunities. Please note: Some of the PDF's are fillable and your web browser may not be able to display them. To use these forms: Right-click on the link. In the menu that appears, click on \"Save link as...\" and save the file to your computer. Open up Adobe Reader (or similar PDF reader). Within Adobe Reader, click on the \"File\" menu on the top and choose \"Open\". Locate the file you just saved, click on it to choose it, and then click on the \"Open\" button. For Full-time, Academic Administrative, or Course Authoring opportunities, please select a Faculty: Don Wright Faculty of Music Faculty of Arts and Humanities Faculty of Education Faculty of Engineering Faculty of Health Sciences Faculty of Information and Media Studies (FIMS) Faculty of Law Faculty of Science Faculty of Social Science Ivey Business School Schulich School of Medicine and Dentistry Special Programs (under Section 14 of the Ontario Human Rights Code) Decanal and Senior Administrative Positions Canada Research Chairs Clinical Faculty Positions (Schulich) Special Programs (under Section 14 of the Ontario Human Rights Code) Full-Time Positions - Application f