      "description": "Faculty Awards and Honours - Awards and Accomplishments - Faculty of Engineering - Western University Skip to Content Faculty / Staff Search First Name Last Name or Department / Unit Search Search String Libraries Maps Parking Directory Websites A - Z Events WebMail OWL Brightspace Student Services WesternU.ca Popular Links Popular Links Directory Mail OWL Brightspace Student Services Websites A - Z Events Libraries Maps Parking WesternU Undergraduate Future Students Current Students Programs First Year Upper Year Experiential Learning Student Clubs Career Services Academic Consideration for Absences Engineering Student Wellness Future Students Graduate Future Students Current Students Postdoctoral Studies Experiential Learning International Students Academic Support Career Services Wellness Resources Awards and Scholarships Campus Life News and Events Research Areas of Expertise Faculty Awards and Honours Institutes and Centres Research Chairs International Western Research The Engineer's Impact Industry Hire a student Research BLWTL Fraunhofer WORLDiscoveries Alumni Events Awards Our Stories Advisory Council of Western Engineering All in Campaign Support Western Engineering Departments Dean's Office Administrative and Ancillary Units Biomedical Engineering Chemical and Biochemical Engineering Civil and Environmental Engineering Electrical and Computer Engineering Engineering Leadership and Innovation Mechanical and Materials Engineering MENU Undergraduate Graduate Research Industry Alumni Departments Home Departments Dean's Office Awards Faculty Awards and Honours Faculty Awards and Honours 2025-2026 Please note that the below award information is updated annually in July/August. For more information, please contact Office of the Dean . View our Awards Archive. International American Institute of Aeronautics and Astronautics: Energy Systems Award Ying Zheng, CBE National Canadian Societies for Chemical Engineering: Bao and Zhu Innovation Awar